Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): careerMatches, employer sign-up + approval,
 PDPA consent
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements the top 4 items of API_CHANGES.md §5.11 against backend B1–B11:
- Result page: "สายงานที่เหมาะกับคุณ" ranking from careerMatches (only when no desired role was entered)
- Register: choose student/employer, company name + tax id, pending-approval screen on EMPLOYER_PENDING (register and login)
- Admin: new "อนุมัติผู้ประกาศงาน" tab (list by status, approve, reject with reason)
- PDPA: send acceptedPolicyVersion on register; consent modal when needsConsent is true
- ApiError now exposes backend `code`; branch on code, not message

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FXJgvtz3biB1HzBcHrNbzm
